      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get the security part but it still feels weird. like, if the seller is the one who actually gets the money in the end, how do i know the escrow company won't just... i dont know, get greedy or something? whats stopping them from just keeping it or mishandling it while they're \"guarding\" it?",
